---
import { GITHUB_URL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="disclosures" class="bg-white border-t border-border">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-5">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg squircle bg-grad-blue grid place-items-center">
            <img src="/logo-mark.svg" alt="" class="w-4 h-4" width="16" height="16" />
          </span>
          <span class="font-bold text-text tracking-tight">{SITE_TITLE}</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-text-muted mb-3">Disclosures</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-text-subtle text-pretty">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text font-semibold">Not investment advice.</strong> Bags, weights, stories, and evidence are editorial
            or public-record information. Nothing here is a recommendation to buy or sell anything. No performance is implied.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text font-semibold">Issuer products.</strong> xStocks are tokenized certificates issued by Backed that
            track listed equities; PreStocks are SPV-based tokens issued by PreStocks that reference private-company marks. Holders do
            not own the underlying shares and have no voting, dividend, or information rights. Each issuer sets its own eligibility;
            xStocks are restricted in some jurisdictions and PreStocks are not available to U.S. persons.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text font-semibold">Thin liquidity is possible.</strong> On-chain quotes can carry measurable price
            impact and token prices can diverge from exchange or issuer prices, especially outside market hours. Total loss is possible.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text font-semibold">Disclosure bags lag.</strong> STOCK Act filings arrive 30–45 days after a trade,
            report ranges rather than amounts, and include spouse trades. They are public records, not a managed or live portfolio,
            and no member of Congress endorses or is affiliated with Stockpile.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text font-semibold">Non-custodial.</strong> Trades are Jupiter swaps signed by your own Privy embedded
            wallet after on-device inspection. Stockpile never holds keys or funds and never submits a transaction on your behalf.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <nav class="flex flex-wrap md:flex-col gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm md:text-right" aria-label="Footer">
        <a href="/#how" class="text-text-subtle hover:text-text transition-colors">How it works</a>
        <a href="/#bags" class="text-text-subtle hover:text-text transition-colors">Bags</a>
        <a href="/#receipts" class="text-text-subtle hover:text-text transition-colors">Receipts</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="text-text-subtle hover:text-text transition-colors">Blog</a>
        <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-text-subtle hover:text-text transition-colors">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://xstocks.fi/products" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-text-subtle hover:text-text transition-colors">xStocks</a>
        <a href="https://prestocks.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-text-subtle hover:text-text transition-colors">PreStocks</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} {SITE_TITLE}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Built for Solana Seeker · stockpile.cash</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
